WEBVTT

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.800
The world is in the Gourmet Age.

00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:30.410
Gourmet Hunters are explorers

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:32.280
who travel the world,

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:33.980
searching for your ingredients.

00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.750
And the ingredient at the top of this world

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.350
is GOD, which is being sought

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:43.220
by one Gourmet Hunter.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:51.960
Go! Shock!! Gourmet!! Gourmet!!

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:58.600
Go! Shock!!

00:01:00.240 --> 00:01:03.270
Friends who can eat the same dream

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.080
Friends who share the same future

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:08.710
With you guys

00:01:08.710 --> 00:01:11.880
It’s first-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.320
If we join forces

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.320
We’ll be invincible

00:01:17.320 --> 00:01:20.930
Come on, let’s show ‘em

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:28.500
Delicious food gives life

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:34.010
So be thankful for everything and

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.070
Let’s eat!!

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:39.080
We can’t lose!! We can’t be stopped!!

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:42.080
We ain’t gonna let ‘em have that

00:01:42.980 --> 00:01:47.320
We’re gonna win it!! Shock! 
Shock! Gourmet king!!

00:01:47.320 --> 00:01:50.320
Spiked Punch!! Infinity!!

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:54.330
I’ll punch through with this fist

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:58.160
First-rate gourmet my way!

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:01.130
Let’s gather ‘round the table

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:05.070
For the sake of tomorrow

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.140
Let’s go! Go! Gourmet!!

00:02:13.340 --> 00:02:16.180
The Cooking Fest began!

00:02:16.580 --> 00:02:19.680
The first event was Triathlon Cooking.

00:02:20.520 --> 00:02:25.020
Brunch, 3rd place in the World Chef 
Ranking, was a late participant.

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.090
Interesting...

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:30.360
The partner of Toriko of the Four Kings...

00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:34.200
Then I think I'll make mincemeat out of him.

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:39.300
But then Brunch caught a glimpse 
of Komatsu's cooking talent.

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:42.040
So this is Komatsu...

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:44.310
Interesting.

00:02:47.080 --> 00:02:49.310
I-It seems Brunch and Chef Komatsu

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:52.720
are going to use the remainder 
of the ingredients!

00:02:54.350 --> 00:02:56.020
Alright, alright!

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:58.060
The ingredients say they wanna go,

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:00.530
so we'll take 'em all with us!

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:03.390
Brunch-san, thank you!

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:08.730
Wha...? Matsu!

00:03:09.300 --> 00:03:11.570
What are you doing hitting it off with him?!

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:12.900
It's only natural.

00:03:13.770 --> 00:03:15.040
What's that?!

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:17.210
Look at the table.

00:03:18.640 --> 00:03:20.680
Something about the tableware?

00:03:24.750 --> 00:03:27.190
Even though he made such a violent entrance,

00:03:27.950 --> 00:03:31.360
only the empty dishes are turned over.

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:35.660
Plates and glasses bearing food 
and drink didn't budge an inch.

00:03:35.660 --> 00:03:37.200
Yes, that's certainly true.

00:03:37.530 --> 00:03:40.470
He may look uncivilized, but he's a chef.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:42.170
Brunch too...

00:03:42.170 --> 00:03:43.530
Hmph.

00:03:44.600 --> 00:03:46.140
On what grounds do you say this?

00:03:46.140 --> 00:03:50.170
Komatsu and Brunch are both 
chefs that love ingredients.

00:03:50.740 --> 00:03:54.710
Since I'm his partner, 
I speak from experience.

00:03:54.710 --> 00:03:56.850
I think that's all the 
grounds you need, right?

00:04:02.090 --> 00:04:04.560
As a chef, it's only natural that

00:04:04.560 --> 00:04:07.730
since Komatsu faces the 
ingredients with sincerity,

00:04:08.260 --> 00:04:11.060
they love him in return.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.540
Alright, you ready?

00:04:18.540 --> 00:04:21.570
We're gonna overtake everybody 
else in a single spurt, Komatsu!

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:24.310
Ready, Brunch-san!

00:04:26.010 --> 00:04:30.680
Playing Dirty! Roaring Ahead! Brunch 
Overtakes Everybody in a Single Spurt!

00:04:33.450 --> 00:04:36.820
120 km to Cooking Island
Time to get there in traffic: 20 hours

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:38.990
120 kilometers?!

00:04:39.320 --> 00:04:41.590
Hey, when are we gonna get there?

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.560
I dunno. We're not moving one bit.

00:04:44.560 --> 00:04:46.730
Come on, when?

00:04:51.800 --> 00:04:53.170
What the...?!

00:05:06.280 --> 00:05:07.820
Giraffe Bird.

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:12.520
A combined clone of a cautious, herbivorous 
Beast with a heightened sense of smell,

00:05:12.520 --> 00:05:17.130
with a carnivorous Beast boasting 
powerful combat ability.

00:05:18.260 --> 00:05:21.830
If suspicious fellows get close, 
they sense it right away.

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:24.700
The howling of the Giraffe Birds

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.970
will mean the beginning of the battle.

00:05:27.740 --> 00:05:29.770
It'll mark the outbreak of war.

00:05:30.340 --> 00:05:33.710
Shoot. And everybody else is 
having a great time at the fest.

00:05:34.010 --> 00:05:37.580
I wanted to sit next to Toriko 
and watch Komatsu compete.

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:47.130
Alright, Triathlon Cooking 
is really heating up!

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:54.300
And here in the arena too, it's as lively 
as food cooked over a high flame!

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:56.400
We're all fired up!

00:05:56.700 --> 00:06:01.070
Fire!

00:06:09.880 --> 00:06:13.550
Let's review the framework 
of this first competition.

00:06:14.250 --> 00:06:19.320
In the first stage, the chefs 
swim to get their ingredients.

00:06:19.320 --> 00:06:20.790
In the second stage, they ride bikes.

00:06:20.790 --> 00:06:22.960
Specifically, to carry the ingredients...

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:25.660
In the last stage, they run a marathon.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:30.300
The goal is here, meaning 
they return to this stadium.

00:06:30.300 --> 00:06:34.070
But the competition doesn't end there.

00:06:34.070 --> 00:06:38.240
They cook the ingredients they brought 
back in a cooking area here at the goal.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:43.720
The seven taste masters of G7 will 
judge the results of their cooking.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:46.780
Out of the 100 competitors, 
only half will remain!

00:06:46.780 --> 00:06:49.520
That is, 50 people!

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:54.790
Currently at the head of the 
pack is Setsuno, Zaus, and Yuda!

00:06:54.790 --> 00:06:57.800
They resemble skewered dumplings 
as they ride the bicycles

00:06:57.800 --> 00:07:02.470
through the Frozen Tofu Wilderness 
of freeze-dried tofu!

00:07:14.910 --> 00:07:16.850
Some distance behind those three are

00:07:16.850 --> 00:07:19.720
the former boss of the underground 
cooking world, Livebearer,

00:07:19.720 --> 00:07:21.690
and Chiru, master of delicate cooking!

00:07:21.690 --> 00:07:24.320
And the chefs nipping at their heels...

00:07:32.700 --> 00:07:33.870
Guillotine Slice.

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:43.010
Par for the course for Kopuriko, 
Queen of Bizarre Eats!

00:07:43.010 --> 00:07:45.440
Her attack is as bizarre as her look!

00:07:45.440 --> 00:07:49.210
I can use this as an ingredient too, right?

00:07:49.210 --> 00:07:51.680
Paper Crocodile as an ingredient?!

00:07:51.680 --> 00:07:55.390
Just how much do you like your bizarre eats?!

00:07:55.390 --> 00:07:57.990
Incidentally, her life's Full Course

00:07:55.390 --> 00:08:09.630
Kopuriko's Full Course
Hors d'Oeuvre: Whole Fried Devil Gecko, Capture Level 42
Soup: Wriggling Mega Mosquito Larvae Soup, Capture Level 35
Fish: Live Sea Piranha, Capture Level 26
Meat: Right Brain of the Long-armed Goblin, Capture Level 31
Main: Raw Alien Golem Liver, Capture Level 45
Salad: Spotted Tarantula Slushy Salad, Capture Level 15
Dessert: Centipede Sea Cucumber Intestine Pudding, Capture Level 12
Drink: Sea Urchin Turtle Body Fluid, Capture Level 28

00:07:57.990 --> 00:08:01.390
starts with Whole Fried Devil 
Gecko as her Hors d'Oeuvre,

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:04.000
then Mega Mosquito Larvae and Sea Piranha,

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:06.360
Long-armed Goblin, Alien Golem,

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:09.630
Spotted Tarantula, Centipede Sea 
Cucumber, and Sea Urchin Turtle!

00:08:09.630 --> 00:08:12.440
They're all grotesque yet gro-yummy!

00:08:12.440 --> 00:08:15.870
Let's move on with the gro-delicious 
food! I'm feeling groggy!

00:08:21.750 --> 00:08:25.050
Oh, my! Gen-chan, the Revolutionary 
Grandpa of Stew, is being charged

00:08:25.050 --> 00:08:27.050
by a level 20 Spare Rib Pig!

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:39.300
Stew from Two Generations Back!

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:42.600
This pig looks like it'd 
go well with my oden.

00:08:42.600 --> 00:08:45.600
Gen-chan does a knockout with his 
Stew from Two Generations Back!

00:08:46.700 --> 00:08:49.710
Gen-chan's life's Full Course starts 
with Old Man Don Simmered Clam

00:08:46.700 --> 00:09:00.180
Gen-chan's Full Course
Hors d'Oeuvre: Old Man Don Simmered Clam, Capture Level 18
Soup: Stew from Two Generations Back, Capture Level Unknown
Fish: Boiled Insomnia Octopus, Capture Level 30
Meat: Maple Tree Beef Tendon Stew, Capture Level 25
Main: Gen-chan's Special Oden, Capture Level Unknown
Salad: Red Kelp Salad Bites, Capture Level 11
Dessert: Snow Fish Cake Red Bean Soup, Capture Level 13
Drink: Black Label "Gen", Capture Level Unknown

00:08:49.710 --> 00:08:52.980
as the Hors d'Oeuvre, then 
the aforementioned stew,

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:55.010
Insomnia Octopus, Maple Tree Beef,

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:56.850
Red Kelp, Snow Fish Cakes,

00:08:56.850 --> 00:09:00.180
and Black Label. They're all 
ingredients that your father loves!

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:05.190
Spare Rib Pig is the real draw of his 
shop and is also one of the materials

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:09.130
for his Full Course Main Dish, 
Gen-chan's Special Oden!

00:09:09.130 --> 00:09:10.930
Uh-oh! Look at this!

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:13.900
A pack of Sand Hamsters 
are attacking the chefs!

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:15.400
Exciting!

00:09:17.400 --> 00:09:19.500
Detox Knife.

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:23.410
As expected of Poison Cuisine 
Chef Tylan, very, very excellent!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.280
His life's Full Course is...

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:35.750
Tylan's Full Course
Hors d'Oeuvre: Dried Puffer Whale Poison Sac, Capture Level 29
Soup: Poisonous Potage, Capture Level 30
Fish: Grilled Poison Turtle, Capture Level 35
Meat: Wine-simmered Cow Carcass, Capture Level 33
Main: Poison King's Instant Kill Meat, Capture Level 49
Salad: Tetra Cheese Killer Salad, Capture Level 27
Dessert: Poison Apple Ice Cream III, Capture Level 19
Drink: Poisoned Lemonade, Capture Level 22

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:28.180
Puffer Whale, Poisonous Potage,

00:09:28.180 --> 00:09:29.880
Poison Turtle, Cow Carcass,

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.120
Poison King, Tetra Cheese,

00:09:32.120 --> 00:09:34.520
Poison Apple, and Poisoned Lemonade!

00:09:34.520 --> 00:09:36.490
It's all poison!

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:41.160
Of them all, the Capture Level 
49 Poison King is a Super Beast,

00:09:41.160 --> 00:09:42.560
but Tylan can kill it in an instant,

00:09:42.560 --> 00:09:47.270
and turn it into delicious food.

00:09:47.270 --> 00:09:49.570
They'll be able to get up again soon.

00:09:49.570 --> 00:09:53.340
And I removed their poison, so they'll 
probably be even more active.

00:09:53.340 --> 00:09:57.640
Oh, dear! The blood-pumping 
race continues!　

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:04.350
Hey, where's Matsu?

00:10:07.320 --> 00:10:10.090
He may be having a tough time.

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:13.160
He's able to carry as many ingredients 
from the beach as he wants.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:16.730
There is no limit,

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:19.100
but he's really loaded up.

00:10:19.100 --> 00:10:22.100
Maybe Brunch can handle 
it, but Komatsu-kun...

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:28.240
Komatsu will be fine.

00:10:28.240 --> 00:10:30.940
What do you have to base all this on?!

00:10:31.210 --> 00:10:33.950
Look, I'm his partner and I'm sayin' it.

00:10:33.950 --> 00:10:36.610
That's plenty to base it on!

00:10:38.720 --> 00:10:43.250
Alright, chefs are going right past the 
violent Beasts without engaging them.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:47.590
The highest-ranking chefs are so strong 
they can put Gourmet Hunters to shame!

00:10:47.590 --> 00:10:50.430
A lot of chefs are former Gourmet Hunters.

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:52.930
And Beasts like these are nothing!

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.500
W-What the...?!

00:11:04.010 --> 00:11:05.610
Get the hell out of the way!

00:11:05.940 --> 00:11:07.580
Heeeere's Brunch!

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:10.110
Brunch?!

00:11:10.110 --> 00:11:12.620
He's passing a bunch all at once!

00:11:33.470 --> 00:11:36.870
Get the hell out of the way!

00:11:36.870 --> 00:11:42.050
He's fast! Brunch with Chef Komatsu 
is passing a bunch at once!

00:11:55.830 --> 00:12:00.370
L-Like Toriko said, 
Komatsu-kun is doing fine.

00:12:00.670 --> 00:12:00.770
Yeah, well...

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:05.670
That's not the kind of 
"fine" I had in mind...

00:12:21.250 --> 00:12:22.850
Mach pedal!

00:12:24.560 --> 00:12:27.390
Two can play that game! Oil kadabra!

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:29.490
My attack! Oil Slick!

00:12:31.700 --> 00:12:36.270
If I coat them with oil, the 
wheels will move more smoothly!

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:39.440
A cheap trick like that?!

00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:44.340
Brunch is moving at a very high speed!

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:47.610
Stop!

00:12:52.120 --> 00:12:53.650
We stopped...

00:12:57.890 --> 00:13:00.660
My foot slipped!

00:13:05.760 --> 00:13:08.470
What did you do?!

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.440
You're an oil-blooded...

00:13:11.440 --> 00:13:13.740
I mean, cold-blooded jerk!

00:13:13.740 --> 00:13:17.780
Uh-oh! Brunch cut off the 
other chefs behind him!

00:13:17.780 --> 00:13:19.780
His foul play knows no bounds!

00:13:21.550 --> 00:13:23.720
This is the world of competition.

00:13:23.720 --> 00:13:27.450
Hey, Brunch-san! You 
can't do stuff like that!

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.550
You've got to play fair and square!

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:34.060
You're right. I only pretended 
that my foot slipped.

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:37.000
Next time, I'll push 'em off 
a cliff fair and square!

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.960
That's not what I mean...

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:42.330
Brunch really is demonic!

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:48.410
Meanwhile, Setsuno, Zaus, and Yuda

00:13:48.410 --> 00:13:50.940
have reached the third area,

00:13:50.940 --> 00:13:53.110
Rock Candy Mountain Pass!

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:55.180
From here, they run the marathon!

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:57.580
It's an intense dead heat!

00:13:57.580 --> 00:13:59.220
Munage-san! Munage-san!

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:02.190
That voice belongs to our 
live reporter, Tina-pyon.

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:06.420
Right, Tina here, not at the water station, 
but the cooking utensils station.

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:08.890
The chefs will come here,

00:14:08.890 --> 00:14:12.300
pick up the cooking utensils 
they prepared ahead of time,

00:14:12.300 --> 00:14:14.870
and head for the goal.

00:14:14.870 --> 00:14:18.040
By the by, the cooking utensils 
station is only open for one hour.

00:14:18.040 --> 00:14:22.810
So if they don't come fast, the chefs 
can't get their favorite cooking utensils.

00:14:22.810 --> 00:14:26.010
There are two important points 
for winning this triathlon.

00:14:26.580 --> 00:14:29.180
The first is getting the best ingredients.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:33.750
The next is retrieving your own cooking 
utensils at the station in time.

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:38.290
So if you do that, you can cook something 
that'll impress the judges, huh?

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:42.590
I'm sure Matsu left his Melk Knife there.

00:14:42.590 --> 00:14:44.760
As long as he's got the Melk Knife...

00:14:46.100 --> 00:14:49.130
...the kid should be able to 
advance to the next round.

00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:52.370
Hey! I got nothin' to drink over here!

00:14:52.370 --> 00:14:53.810
Yes, sir! I'll be right there!

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:01.650
The leaders of the pack!

00:15:01.650 --> 00:15:05.750
The three chefs, Setsuno, 
Zaus, and Yuda are here!

00:15:10.420 --> 00:15:13.830
Oh, my! They suddenly disappeared!

00:15:13.830 --> 00:15:16.660
N-No! They passed through the 
cooking utensils station!

00:15:17.030 --> 00:15:18.800
They have their favorite cooking utensils

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:22.300
and are running as fast as lightning, 
too fast for the eye to see even a gram!

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:25.170
Granny Setsu, Zaus, and Yuda.

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:29.970
Their abilities blow all the 
other chefs out of the water.

00:15:29.970 --> 00:15:33.880
Oh, my! Three of the participants 
have quickly arrived at the stadium!

00:15:33.880 --> 00:15:35.180
That is fast! Already?!

00:15:36.250 --> 00:15:40.420
Is their first, second, and 
third place order a sure thing?

00:15:41.420 --> 00:15:43.890
Who will be the first to cross the goal?!

00:15:43.890 --> 00:15:45.690
Meal King Yuda?!

00:15:45.690 --> 00:15:47.360
Cooking King Zaus?!

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:50.260
Or National Treasure Setsuno?!

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:52.330
Who will it be?! Who?!

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:54.900
Who will it be?!

00:16:20.190 --> 00:16:22.760
Who crossed the goal?

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:26.200
The one who crossed the goal is...

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:33.240
Brunch and...

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:35.570
...Chef Komatsu!

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:45.380
O-Oh, my...

00:16:47.090 --> 00:16:49.890
Brunch the Tengu with Chef Komatsu

00:16:49.890 --> 00:16:52.560
crossed the goal first!

00:16:52.560 --> 00:16:55.730
What a delicious dramatic turnabout!

00:16:56.730 --> 00:16:58.400
Komatsu-kun is in first place?

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:00.700
I didn't think he'd do that well.

00:17:00.700 --> 00:17:03.200
You know, he looks older.

00:17:04.140 --> 00:17:09.310
Well, well. It's unusual for the 
problem child to participate in this.

00:17:09.310 --> 00:17:11.240
It is indeed a rare sight.

00:17:11.740 --> 00:17:13.650
It ain't nothin'.

00:17:13.650 --> 00:17:16.210
I just thought I'd put a fork into

00:17:16.210 --> 00:17:18.450
you old farts and your gerontocracy.

00:17:19.420 --> 00:17:21.890
Who are you calling an 
old fart, you greenhorn?!

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.520
You are old farts!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:26.590
Seriously, how long are you gonna 
lord it over the industry?!

00:17:26.590 --> 00:17:27.960
You're all speed bumps!

00:17:27.960 --> 00:17:29.990
H-Hey, Brunch-san!

00:17:29.990 --> 00:17:32.360
Don't get fresh, youngster.

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:33.700
Shut up, beardie!

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:34.570
Beardie?!

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.270
What's with that beard?!

00:17:36.270 --> 00:17:37.540
It's lame!

00:17:37.540 --> 00:17:40.640
Don't get cocky, you little tengu turd!

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:42.640
Okay, okay, calm down.

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:44.580
And Brunch, you're going too far.

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:46.340
Shut it, beardie number two!

00:17:46.340 --> 00:17:47.380
Beardie number two?!

00:17:47.380 --> 00:17:49.310
That's it! Battle like that!

00:17:49.310 --> 00:17:50.550
Beat 'em, Brunch!

00:17:51.020 --> 00:17:53.690
Hey, he's even pickin' a 
fight with Granny Setsu.

00:18:02.960 --> 00:18:06.560
In any case, you're in 
first place, Koma-chan!

00:18:07.230 --> 00:18:10.100
85 chefs have finished the race!

00:18:10.100 --> 00:18:12.070
Somehow, I managed to squeak by.

00:18:12.870 --> 00:18:14.540
But...!

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:17.040
It would be no overstatement to say

00:18:17.040 --> 00:18:20.080
the real trial of Triathlon 
Cooking is about to begin!

00:18:20.080 --> 00:18:22.510
Everyone, you'll cook the 
ingredients that you brought back

00:18:22.510 --> 00:18:24.850
up there on that competition stage.

00:18:24.850 --> 00:18:27.550
G7 will judge your efforts.

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:31.920
The 85 chefs who finished the 
race will be pared down to 50!

00:18:32.960 --> 00:18:35.160
The top batter is...

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:38.030
...Brunch the Tengu and the chef 
who shares first place with him,

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:40.770
Chef Komatsu!

00:18:42.070 --> 00:18:44.870
R-R-Right!

00:18:55.380 --> 00:18:57.150
His heart's beatin' fast.

00:18:59.180 --> 00:19:02.420
Looks like the kid's really nervous.

00:19:02.420 --> 00:19:05.690
What? Here's where Komatsu 
shows his true ability.

00:19:05.690 --> 00:19:07.190
That's right.

00:19:07.190 --> 00:19:09.290
With the physical strength aspect,

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:11.830
that is, the triathlon itself, he 
was at a complete disadvantage.

00:19:11.830 --> 00:19:13.000
But when it comes to cooking ability,

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:16.470
he should give the top-ranked 
chefs a good run for their money.

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.240
He'll be alright.

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:21.540
After all, I'm sure he got his Melk 
Knife, which he's used to using.

00:19:21.910 --> 00:19:23.040
True...

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:26.440
Komatsu's Melk Knife thing 
does give him an edge.

00:19:26.940 --> 00:19:29.510
Chef Komatsu is entering the cooking area.

00:19:30.050 --> 00:19:34.220
According my information, the knife 
left at the utensils station was...

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:37.560
Oh, my! A Melk Knife! And not only that,

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:41.390
it's apparently the first blade 
ever crafted by Melk the Second!

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:47.300
Are we going to see that knife 
here at Cooking Stadium?!

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:49.500
Komatsu, buckle down.

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:58.240
That ain't his Melk Knife!

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:03.050
Huh? That's a regular old knife.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:04.350
Say what?!

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:05.750
That idiot!

00:20:06.420 --> 00:20:07.620
Matsu...

00:20:07.620 --> 00:20:08.520
Komatsu-kun?

00:20:08.520 --> 00:20:09.750
Kid...

00:20:09.750 --> 00:20:11.590
Hey, what the hell's goin' on here?

00:20:15.090 --> 00:20:20.030
Hey, Komatsu! What's the matter with you?!

00:20:30.240 --> 00:20:33.910
Tomorrow’s wind is gonna blow tomorrow

00:20:33.910 --> 00:20:40.650
So your adventurous life will be sensational

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:46.260
Only a smile has no flavor, 
so wipe your tears

00:20:46.260 --> 00:20:52.860
After a downpour of rain from the 
sky, the sun always rises high

00:20:52.860 --> 00:20:58.500
Every time I know you’re working up a sweat

00:20:58.500 --> 00:21:04.010
My heart races and I become captivated

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:13.150
Don’t give up! I’m closest to 
you in the middle of a challenge

00:21:13.650 --> 00:21:17.620
Always believe in yourself!

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:30.500
Guess the Legend
The Legend Gourmet Quiz

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:28.530
Guess the Legend!

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:30.500
The Legend Gourmet Quiz!

00:21:31.100 --> 00:21:32.900
I'm your host, Tina.

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:36.840
Alright, this is a heaping helping 
of an epoch-making segment,

00:21:36.840 --> 00:21:39.440
in which you guess the legendary 
ingredients of the Gourmet Age!

00:21:43.080 --> 00:21:49.220
Really?! Level 2

00:21:43.880 --> 00:21:47.250
Today's "Really?!" level is 2.

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:49.150
Someone once said...

00:21:49.750 --> 00:21:52.920
Heavenly voice! Please help me today too!

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:55.990
Sure, sure. Okay, here I go.

00:21:55.990 --> 00:21:58.930
Someone once said...

00:21:59.160 --> 00:22:03.200
There are lions made of 
delicious corn on the cob...

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:06.670
Blah-blah-blah!

00:22:06.670 --> 00:22:09.170
The allotted time limit is 10 seconds.

00:22:09.170 --> 00:22:10.940
Start!

00:22:11.440 --> 00:22:13.710
Lions made of corn on the cob?

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:16.380
Let's say you don't have to 
worry about the cob part.

00:22:17.720 --> 00:22:19.280
Just corn?

00:22:19.280 --> 00:22:20.950
Lions and corn...

00:22:22.350 --> 00:22:25.520
Someone once said...

00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:29.290
There are lions made of 
delicious corn on the cob...

00:22:29.290 --> 00:22:33.230
Licorn!

00:22:35.800 --> 00:22:37.400
Licorn!

00:22:37.400 --> 00:22:41.010
It looks like it would be 
tough picking the lion's mane.

00:22:41.010 --> 00:22:43.340
Sure, if it really existed...

00:22:45.810 --> 00:22:49.280
Okay, let's get back on 
track with our next segment!

00:22:52.170 --> 00:22:53.660
Things are heating up!

00:22:53.660 --> 00:22:56.180
A cooking battle aboard a sizzling iron plate.

00:22:56.180 --> 00:22:58.320
Komatsu VS Wabutora the oil user!

00:22:58.320 --> 00:23:01.140
Live or Die? Death in the Balance Cooking!

00:23:01.140 --> 00:23:02.940
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
